                        <h4>Computer Science & Graphics</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>CIELAB color model (∛):</strong> L* = 116 × ∛(Y/Yn) − 16</li>
                            <li><strong>Vector normalization (√):</strong> divide by √(x²+y²+z²)</li>
